From c6b9c6f35e406e491415ca28f00d15e708506926 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Feb 2026 10:04:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 444/572] fix(st-pmic): check stpmic2_is_buck1_high_voltage
 return

There was no check on stpmic2_is_buck1_high_voltage() for buck1 in
register_pmic2 function. Add a check on ret, and return with an error
message in case of error.
This was found with Coverity analysis (unused_value).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 617d2bc8abdeaf7a95d1362e4016f52031c96321 fix(st-pmic): check stpmic2_is_buck1_high_voltage return]
Change-Id: I0a269aadb5344a29f94302c8d4ff6cd41773961f
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/541287
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c b/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c
index c8b59f5a06..94a45045ee 100644
--- a/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c
+++ b/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 /*
- * Copyright (C) 2024-2025, STMicroelectronics - All Rights Reserved
+ * Copyright (C) 2024-2026, STMicroelectronics - All Rights Reserved
  *
  * SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
  */
@@ -486,6 +486,10 @@ static int register_pmic2(void)
 			bool high;
 
 			ret = stpmic2_is_buck1_high_voltage(pmic2, &high);
+			if (ret != 0) {
+				ERROR("Failed to get buck1 info\n");
+				return ret;
+			}
 			if (high) {
 				reg_name = "buck1h";
 			}
